  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The night post between worlds.",
    "overview": "A quiet supernatural post office built from midnight teal, warm cream paper, brass, dark wood, and vermilion wax. Original flat vector artwork establishes the room; the letter remains a stable, readable object on the desk. The character is inviting, witty, and slightly uncanny.\n\nThis records the existing implementation, governed by the locked `IMPLEMENTATION_SPEC.txt`. Preserve the illustrated postal identity as the interface grows. Reading and completing a six-letter shift take priority over atmosphere, decorative detail, motion, and sound.",
